{"id":"12fe2c789b4c78f9","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-properness-criteria.md","title":"Properness Criteria","display":"thm-properness-criteria — Properness Criteria","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-properness-criteria","aliases":["58-thm-properness-criteria"],"display":"thm-properness-criteria — Properness Criteria","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-properness-criteria"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-properness-criteria</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-properness-criteria — Properness Criteria"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper\">../batch06/58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable\">../batch14/58-df-countable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset\">../batch02/58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6aba3343ae870e5\" href=\"?note=c6aba3343ae870e5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span> (forcing carrier)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> (sufficiently large regular cardinal) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\prec H_\\theta\">\\(M\\prec H_\\theta\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (proper-forcing predicate from dependency)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S\\)</span> (master-condition predicate with the required predensity-below-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> clause)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span> (canonical predicates from the proper-forcing dependency)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}properness\\text{-}criteria}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\exists\\theta_0\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta_0)\\land\\forall\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\theta_0\\leq\\theta\n\\to\\forall H_\\theta,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in H_\\theta\n\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S(\nq,p,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\theta\n)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}properness\\text{-}criteria}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\exists\\theta_0\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta_0)\\land\\forall\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\theta_0\\leq\\theta\n\\to\\forall H_\\theta,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in H_\\theta\n\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S(\nq,p,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\theta\n)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is existentially bound on the right, matching the carrier-level predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\\)</span> on the left.</li>\n<li>Countable elementary submodels detect properness through master conditions for every sufficiently large regular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The criterion now quantifies the actual <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\theta\">\\(H_\\theta\\)</span> carrier and canonical membership structures before invoking elementarity; raw sets are not first-order structures.</li>\n<li>The witness requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\cap M\">\\(D\\cap M\\)</span> to be predense below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> for each dense <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in M\">\\(D\\in M\\)</span>; compatibility with a single member only at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> would be too weak.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness","status":"resolved","id":"c6aba3343ae870e5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-properness-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"M\\prec H_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}properness\\text{-}criteria}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\exists\\theta_0\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta_0)\\land\\forall\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\theta_0\\leq\\theta\n\\to\\forall H_\\theta,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in H_\\theta\n\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\mathfrak H\n\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\to\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\cap M\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PropernessWitness}_S(\nq,p,M,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\theta\n)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Biggr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proper}(\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"D\\cap M","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":2700,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4379","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-properness-criteria.md|58-thm-properness-criteria]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","8935dcac821c0104","1b3610e6aed65b25","0fbfc19800246e77","d3f859dbdd37f018","c6aba3343ae870e5"]}